        "backstory": {
          "v": "Penny grabbed her shopping bag when the HyperNorm wall shook, on the grounds that a bag must contain something essential. It held one roll. The Men in Black requested an orderly account; Hunky and Dory suggested orderly feelings. A contradictory card asked whether preparedness could include being frightened. Penny is considering it while making sure the neighbour beside her gets half the roll.",
