        "backstory": {
          "v": "Dot has stopped on the HyperNorm landing while his thoughts negotiate the next frame. The building offers safe and unsafe; neither explains what to do with both hands. The Men in Black ask for a response, and Hunky and Dory ask for a faster one. An ambiguous card has taught a neighbour to wait beside him without issuing advice. Dot finds this considerably easier to move towards.",
