        "backstory": {
          "v": "Nora used to keep HyperNorm problems in separate mental drawers until several arrived together. The Men in Black insist that each has a correct category; Hunky and Dory keep providing new drawers. A contradictory card says that needing a pause is not the same as refusing an answer. She has pinned nothing up and made no announcement. She simply lets the next neighbour breathe before asking what happened.",
